%% Product Protocol — governed-object lifecycle (PP-0002 §6.2)
%% Applies to Goal, Capability, Specification, Constitution, Feature,
%% Story, GoldenTest. The Task state machine is in state-machines-task.mmd.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft
    draft --> proposed : submit
    proposed --> draft : revise
    proposed --> approved : human approval (Decision)
    approved --> deprecated : supersede / retire
    deprecated --> archived
    archived --> [*]
